{"verse_key": "10:107", "surah": 10, "verse": 107, "text_uthmani": "وَإِن يَمْسَسْكَ ٱللَّهُ بِضُرٍّ فَلَا كَاشِفَ لَهُۥٓ إِلَّا هُوَ ۖ وَإِن يُرِدْكَ بِخَيْرٍ فَلَا رَآدَّ لِفَضْلِهِۦ ۚ يُصِيبُ بِهِۦ مَن يَشَآءُ مِنْ عِبَادِهِۦ ۚ وَهُوَ ٱلْغَفُورُ ٱلرَّحِيمُ", "translation": "And if Allāh should touch you with adversity, there is no remover of it except Him; and if He intends for you good, then there is no repeller of His bounty. He causes it to reach whom He wills of His servants. And He is the Forgiving, the Merciful.", "verse_from_ms": 2270810, "verse_to_ms": 2301270, "audio_url": "https://download.quranicaudio.com/qdc/khalifah_taniji/murattal/10.mp3", "words": [{"i": 0, "text": "وَإِن", "start_ms": 2270810, "end_ms": 2272350}, {"i": 1, "text": "يَمْسَسْكَ", "start_ms": 2272350, "end_ms": 2273230}, {"i": 2, "text": "ٱللَّهُ", "start_ms": 2273230, "end_ms": 2274020}, {"i": 3, "text": "بِضُرٍّ", "start_ms": 2274020, "end_ms": 2275430}, {"i": 4, "text": "فَلَا", "start_ms": 2275430, "end_ms": 2276010}, {"i": 5, "text": "كَاشِفَ", "start_ms": 2276010, "end_ms": 2276930}, {"i": 6, "text": "لَهُۥٓ", "start_ms": 2276930, "end_ms": 2278590}, {"i": 7, "text": "إِلَّا", "start_ms": 2278590, "end_ms": 2279380}, {"i": 8, "text": "هُوَ", "start_ms": 2279380, "end_ms": 2279950}, {"i": 9, "text": "ۖ", "start_ms": 2279950, "end_ms": 2282040}, {"i": 10, "text": "وَإِن", "start_ms": 2282040, "end_ms": 2282810}, {"i": 11, "text": "يُرِدْكَ", "start_ms": 2282810, "end_ms": 2284160}, {"i": 12, "text": "بِخَيْرٍ", "start_ms": 2284160, "end_ms": 2284790}, {"i": 13, "text": "فَلَا", "start_ms": 2284790, "end_ms": 2287910}, {"i": 14, "text": "رَآدَّ", "start_ms": 2287910, "end_ms": 2289640}, {"i": 15, "text": "لِفَضْلِهِۦ", "start_ms": 2289640, "end_ms": 2290530}, {"i": 16, "text": "ۚ", "start_ms": 2290530, "end_ms": 2291080}, {"i": 17, "text": "يُصِيبُ", "start_ms": 2291080, "end_ms": 2291270}, {"i": 18, "text": "بِهِۦ", "start_ms": 2291270, "end_ms": 2294200}, {"i": 19, "text": "مَ